[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16021.59, "timestamp": "04:27:01", "text": "很快就能坐上喷气式飞机了。我希望如此。我将"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16023.11, "timestamp": "04:27:03", "text": "如果你得到了而我没有，我会非常生气。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16025.51, "timestamp": "04:27:05", "text": "得到它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16027.51, "timestamp": "04:27:07", "text": "不，如果我得不到，那东西就要报废了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16031.349, "timestamp": "04:27:11", "text": "它。不，问题是，我不会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16034.309, "timestamp": "04:27:14", "text": "心里想着要努力，但同时我也觉得我得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16036.07, "timestamp": "04:27:16", "text": "就像很多合作项目等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16039.03, "timestamp": "04:27:19", "text": "计划。不，我比你更有男子气概。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16042.87, "timestamp": "04:27:22", "text": "等等，到底过了几周来着？它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16047.83, "timestamp": "04:27:27", "text": "课程共八个模块，每个模块为期两天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16050.63, "timestamp": "04:27:30", "text": "所以，你必须完成每个方格。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16053.189, "timestamp": "04:27:33", "text": "模块。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16055.51, "timestamp": "04:27:35", "text": "所以这种情况会持续两天。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16058.75, "timestamp": "04:27:38", "text": "假设从今天中午12点开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16062.389, "timestamp": "04:27:42", "text": "夜晚。将于12日星期一或星期二结束。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16066.55, "timestamp": "04:27:46", "text": "晚上。呃，就像那个模块一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16068.63, "timestamp": "04:27:48", "text": "然后就在周一晚上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16071.269, "timestamp": "04:27:51", "text": "下一个模块开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16073.79, "timestamp": "04:27:53", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16075.51, "timestamp": "04:27:55", "text": "是的。你怎么认为？他们要走了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16079.67, "timestamp": "04:27:59", "text": "为了方便您。我的天啊。那"}]